These patches were generated by the following semantic patch

// <smpl>
@@ expression E; @@
- if (E != NULL) { kfree(E); }
+ kfree(E);

@@ expression E; @@
- if (E != NULL) { kfree(E); E = NULL; }
+ kfree(E);
+ E = NULL;
// </smpl>

with some minor edits against the staging-next branch,
commit 0789b0033112e301f086f99bd15c7d67c051a51e.

